{"articleNo":"2449","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2449&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-1학기 대학원(산업,교육 및 컨설팅) 휴복학 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.02.16","hit":"12473","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">1. 휴&nbsp; 학(인터넷 접수) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2010. 2. 16(화) ~ 2. 19(금) [4일간]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수절차 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 우리대학 홈페이지 원스톱서비스 로그인 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 학적 → 휴학신청접수 → 군입대 및 질병휴학자 관련서류제출(24시간이내)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪특히 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인정보를 입력하여야 함≫ </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">휴학 확정 여부 확인 : 접수 및 구비서류 제출 후 다음날 오후 1시 이후(휴일제외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪조회 : 원스톱서비스 → 학적→ 학적 및 각종자료조회 → 학적변동≫</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 일반휴학은 수업일수 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">1/4선(3월26일)까지만 허용됨</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">(부득이한 사유가 있는 경우)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;다. 인터넷으로 휴학 신청시 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"91\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">구 분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">일반휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"247\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">군입대휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"239\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">질병휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"91\" height=\"58\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">제출해야 할</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">구비 서류</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffccff\" height=\"58\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">제출서류 없음</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"247\" height=\"58\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">입영통지서 또는 군복무확인서 사본 1부</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">※ 증빙서 하단에 학번 및 연락처 반드시 기재</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"239\" height=\"58\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">4주이상 진단서 1부</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">※ 증빙서 하단에 학번 및 연락처 반드시 기재</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"91\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">제출기일</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">및 장소</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffccff\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">제출서류 없음</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"486\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">휴학신청 후 24시간 이내 제출해야 됨</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">대학원지원팀(글로벌관 412호)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"91\" height=\"97\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">유의사항</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#ffccff\" height=\"97\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"486\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"97\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">구비서류 미제출자는 3일 후 휴학신청이 자동 취소됩니다.</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">구비서류 FAX전송자는 도착여부 반드시 확인 바랍니다.</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;FAX.(054)478-7020&nbsp;&nbsp; TEL.(054)478-7015</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">※ 군입대 휴학 후 귀향조치 또는 입영거부 학생은 즉시 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;대학원지원팀에 신고하여야 합니다.&nbsp; </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2. 복&nbsp; 학(인터넷 접수) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2010. 2. 16(화) ~ 2. 19(금) [4일간]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 복학신청은 등록금 완납 후 다음날 오후 1시부터 신청 가능 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 등록금을 납부하고 휴학한 학생은 인터넷으로 복학신청이 가능함. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">군제대복학예정자의 전역일자가 1/4선(3월 26일) 이후일 경우에는 대학원지원팀&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;☎(054)478-7015로 문의 바람 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수절차 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 우리대학 홈페이지 원스톱서비스 로그인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 학적 → 복학신청접수 ≪특히 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인정보를 입력 바람≫ </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 복학 확정 여부 확인 : 접수 후 다음날 오후1시 이후(휴일제외)&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪조회 : 원스톱서비스 → 학적→ 학적 및 각종자료조회 → 학적변동≫</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">※ 복학 허가는 수업일수 1/4선(3월 26일)까지만 허용이 가능함 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;단, 등록기간(10. 2. 16 ~ 2. 19)내에 등록금을 납부한 학생만 해당됨</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
